        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Husband reports gradual decline over 6–9 months, with more repetition, sometimes unsure of the day/date, and needing prompting for medications and meals. Patient reports she is not as sharp with new information but feels day-to-day fairly stable."
      }
    },
    {
