          "text": "Reported behaviour"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Evening agitation, restlessness, irritability, and some suspiciousness, including saying that others are moving her things. No aggression. No clear hallucinations; occasionally misreads shadows."
